{
  "description": "Scenarios for the golden tests. Go (golden_test.go) and the client (client/src/predict/golden.test.ts) both run each one through the physics package, natively and in WebAssembly, and compare every step's state with golden.json. A change applies before the step it names, counting from 0, and keeps its values until the next change.",
